NOTICE — 07-model-embeddings-internals
======================================

WHAT THIS IS

A coursework exercise examining the input and output embedding paths of a
language model, and specifically whether the Kronecker byte codec can be
inverted and used as the output head. It is a study, not a product, not a
proposal to any organisation, and not infrastructure anybody operates. No large
model has been trained with it.

